<title>USA: U.S. Plains fed cattle sell $68, up $1 - feedlots.</title>
<headline>U.S. Plains fed cattle sell $68, up $1 - feedlots.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Plains feedlot cattle sold at $68.00 per cwt in active trading late Wednesday, up $1.00 from the bulk sales last week, feedlot sources said.</p>
<p>About 20,000 head sold in the Texas Panhandle and western Oklahoma area and about 11,000 in Kansas, the sources said.</p>
